{"seq":1,"slug":"osi-tcpip-model","title":"OSI与TCP/IP模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/osi-tcpip-model","wordCount":1421,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"osi与tcp-ip模型\">OSI与TCP/IP模型</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>网络通信的本质是不同计算设备之间按照约定规则交换数据的过程，而OSI参考模型和TCP/IP协议族正是这套规则的核心框架。理解分层模型不仅是通过网络认证考试的基础考点，更是排查网络故障、分析协议交互时的核心思维工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"osi七层参考模型\">OSI七层参考模型</h3><p>ISO于1984年发布的开放系统互联参考模型将网络通信划分为七个功能层次：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;应用层 Application&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;表示层 Presentation&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;会话层 Session&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;传输层 Transport&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;网络层 Network&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;数据链路层 Data Link&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;物理层 Physical&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"应用层 Application\"] --&gt; B[\"表示层 Presentation\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"会话层 Session\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"传输层 Transport\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"网络层 Network\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"数据链路层 Data Link\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"物理层 Physical\"]</pre><p>各层核心职责如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理层</strong>：定义电气信号、光信号的传输规范，包括接口类型（RJ45、SFP+）、编码方式（NRZ、4B/5B）和传输介质（双绞线、光纤、无线电波）</li>\n<li><strong>数据链路层</strong>：实现相邻节点之间的可靠帧传输，MAC地址寻址，错误检测（CRC校验），典型协议包括Ethernet II和IEEE 802.11</li>\n<li><strong>网络层</strong>：负责端到端的逻辑寻址和路由转发，IP地址编址方案，路由协议选路决策</li>\n<li><strong>传输层</strong>：提供端到端的可靠或尽力传输服务，TCP通过三次握手建立连接保证可靠性，UDP提供无连接的低延迟传输</li>\n<li><strong>会话层</strong>：管理通信会话的建立、维护和终止，如RPC远程过程调用的会话管理</li>\n<li><strong>表示层</strong>：数据格式转换、加密解密、压缩解压，如SSL/TLS加密、JPEG编码</li>\n<li><strong>应用层</strong>：为用户应用程序提供网络服务接口，包括HTTP、FTP、SMTP、DNS等协议</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"tcp-ip四层模型\">TCP/IP四层模型</h3><p>实际互联网运行的协议栈是TCP/IP模型，它将OSI的七层简化合并为四层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TCP/IP层次</th>\n<th>对应OSI层</th>\n<th>核心协议</th>\n<th>PDU名称</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>应用层+表示层+会话层</td>\n<td>HTTP, DNS, DHCP, SMTP, SSH</td>\n<td>数据(Data)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>TCP, UDP</td>\n<td>段(Segment)/数据报(Datagram)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网际层</td>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>IP, ICMP, ARP, IGMP</td>\n<td>分组(Packet)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络接口层</td>\n<td>数据链路层+物理层</td>\n<td>Ethernet, WiFi, PPP</td>\n<td>帧(Frame)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据封装与解封装\">数据封装与解封装</h3><p>数据从应用层向下传递时，每经过一层都会添加该层的协议头部（Header），这个过程称为封装（Encapsulation）。接收端执行相反的解封装（Decapsulation）过程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;应用数据&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;+TCP头&quot;| B[&quot;TCP段&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;+IP头&quot;| C[&quot;IP分组&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;+帧头+帧尾&quot;| D[&quot;以太网帧&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;+前导码&quot;| E[&quot;比特流&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"应用数据\"] --&gt;|\"+TCP头\"| B[\"TCP段\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"+IP头\"| C[\"IP分组\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"+帧头+帧尾\"| D[\"以太网帧\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"+前导码\"| E[\"比特流\"]</pre><p>以一次HTTP请求为例，总的封装开销可以计算为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>封装效率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>应用数据长度</mtext><mrow><mtext>应用数据</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>TCP头</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>IP头</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>帧头</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>FCS</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{封装效率} = \\frac{\\text{应用数据长度}}{\\text{应用数据} + \\text{TCP头}(20B) + \\text{IP头}(20B) + \\text{帧头}(14B) + \\text{FCS}(4B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">封装效率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应用数据</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TCP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">头</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">头</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">帧头</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FCS</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应用数据长度</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于一个1460字节的HTTP载荷，传输效率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1460</mn><mrow><mn>1460</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1460</mn><mn>1518</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>96.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{1460}{1460 + 20 + 20 + 14 + 4} = \\frac{1460}{1518} \\approx 96.2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1460</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1460</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1518</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1460</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">96.2%</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"核心协议工作机制\">核心协议工作机制</h3><p><strong>DNS域名解析流程</strong>：客户端发起递归查询 → 本地DNS服务器执行迭代查询（根DNS → 顶级域DNS → 权威DNS）→ 返回IP地址并缓存。DNS使用UDP端口53（查询）和TCP端口53（区域传送）。</p>\n<p><strong>ARP地址解析协议</strong>：当主机知道目标IP但不知道MAC地址时，广播ARP Request（目标MAC: FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF）→ 目标主机单播ARP Reply返回自己的MAC地址 → 发送方更新ARP缓存表。</p>\n<p><strong>DHCP动态地址分配</strong>：采用四步交互 DORA流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Discover</strong>：客户端广播寻找DHCP服务器</li>\n<li><strong>Offer</strong>：服务器提供可用IP地址和配置参数</li>\n<li><strong>Request</strong>：客户端选择并请求确认</li>\n<li><strong>ACK</strong>：服务器确认分配，租约生效</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"wireshark抓包分析实践\">Wireshark抓包分析实践</h3><p>Wireshark是网络工程师必备的协议分析工具。关键操作技能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>捕获过滤器：<code>host 192.168.1.1</code>、<code>port 80</code>、<code>tcp</code></li>\n<li>显示过滤器：<code>http.request.method == &quot;GET&quot;</code>、<code>dns.qry.name contains &quot;example&quot;</code></li>\n<li>TCP流追踪：右键 → Follow → TCP Stream 查看完整会话</li>\n<li>I/O图表：Statistics → I/O Graphs 分析流量趋势</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过抓包可以直观验证三次握手（SYN → SYN-ACK → ACK）和四次挥手（FIN → ACK → FIN → ACK）过程中的序列号和确认号变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>QUIC协议（HTTP/3底层传输协议）正在取代TCP成为新一代传输层标准，它基于UDP实现，将TLS 1.3握手与传输层握手合并为一步，实现0-RTT连接恢复。2025年后全球已有超过40%的HTTPS流量使用QUIC协议。</p>\n<p>IPv6部署持续加速，中国三大运营商IPv6活跃用户数已突破7.5亿。IPv6简化了IP头部结构（固定40字节），移除了校验和字段（交由上层协议处理），增加了Flow Label实现流量标识，为网络切片和QoS提供原生支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用Wireshark捕获一次完整的HTTP网页访问过程，标注出每个数据包所处的协议层次和封装结构</li>\n<li>在命令行中执行 <code>nslookup www.huawei.com</code> 和 <code>tracert www.huawei.com</code>，分析DNS解析和路由跳转的完整路径</li>\n<li>计算题：某网络MTU为9000字节（巨帧），TCP有效载荷最大为多少？相比标准1500字节MTU，传输效率提升了多少？</li>\n<li>对比TCP和UDP在视频通话场景中的适用性，说明为什么视频会议软件通常选择UDP而非TCP</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>OSI七层模型提供了理解网络通信的标准思维框架，TCP/IP四层模型则是互联网实际运行的协议体系。掌握数据封装与解封装过程是排查网络故障的核心能力——当某一层出现问题时，可以通过抓包定位到具体的协议层进行针对性分析。DNS、ARP、DHCP等基础协议构成了网络通信的&quot;水电煤&quot;基础设施，熟练使用Wireshark进行协议分析是从理论学习走向工程实践的关键桥梁。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OSI与TCP/IP模型","id":"osi与tcp-ip模型"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"OSI七层参考模型","id":"osi七层参考模型"},{"level":3,"text":"TCP/IP四层模型","id":"tcp-ip四层模型"},{"level":3,"text":"数据封装与解封装","id":"数据封装与解封装"},{"level":3,"text":"核心协议工作机制","id":"核心协议工作机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Wireshark抓包分析实践","id":"wireshark抓包分析实践"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"路由交换基础技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/routing-switching-fundamentals"}}